                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator text-medical-500"></i> แบบจำลองคณิตศาสตร์ความก้าวร้าว (Aggression Model)
                </h3>
                
                <div class="bg-navy-900/90 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs text-sky-300 overflow-x-auto">
                    Aggression Index (AGI) = <br>
                    <span class="text-red-400">(Stim × 0.45)</span> + 
                    <span class="text-amber-400">(1 / Dist × 20)</span> - 
                    <span class="text-emerald-400">(Tone × 0.5)</span> + Amphet_Bonus
                </div>

                <!-- Live Calculated Metrics -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 text-center">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block mb-1">ดัชนีความก้าวร้าว (AGI)</span>
                        <span id="calc-agi" class="text-xl font-bold text-red-400">82.5</span>
                    </div>
